        "body": "Adobe is a public company, traded as ADBE, founded in 1982 and headquartered in San Jose, California. Its most recent annual filing is a 10-K covering the period ending November 28, 2025, reporting revenue of $23,769,000,000. The company's site centers on Adobe Express, which it describes as an all-in-one design, photo, and video tool for making social content, videos, and logos. The site also describes an AI Assistant 2 that lets users prompt, create, and edit, with quick edits and layer refinement that keep the parts of a design the user wants to keep.\n\nThe company's AI products include Adobe Express AI, described as lightweight design AI for quick content creation with Adobe Firefly integration and commercial-safe use; Adobe Firefly for image generation, with a commercial-safe training claim; Premiere Pro AI for professional video work such as generative extend and color match, also with a commercial-safe training claim; and Adobe Podcast AI for audio and speech enhancement and microphone check, with the same commercial-safe training claim.\n\nOn litigation, the company's recorded exposure is in California, with a count of 281.",
